0,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"他低下头，在她的发顶深深地吻了一下，呼吸间全是她身上淡淡的馥桂花香。他的声音低沉而温柔，带着一丝不易察觉的轻颤。","roundId":"round_1782839923220_hlyapwtdg","userId":"uid_1776582415926_1pk28whsh","characterId":"43acfb2a-2750-4525-9105-d6cef334953c","_id":50741},{"id":1782823522250,"text":"只有一点点吗？","rawContent":"只有一点点吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1782839946709,"roundId":"round_1782839923220_hlyapwtdg","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1776582415926_1pk28whsh","characterId":"43acfb2a-2750-4525-9105-d6cef334953c","_id":50742},{"id":1782823522251,"text":"那明天呢？明天会不会比今天再多喜欢一点点？","rawContent":"那明天呢？明天会不会比今天再多喜欢一点点？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1782839949708,"roundId":"round_1782839923220_hlyapwtdg","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1776582415926_1pk28whsh","characterId":"43acfb2a-2750-4525-9105-d6cef334953c","_id":50743},{"id":1782823522252,"sender":"them","text":"他没有等她回答，只是将下巴轻轻抵在她的额头上，像是在对她承诺，又像是在对自己低语。","timestamp":1782839949712,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"他没有等她回答，只是将下巴轻轻抵在她的额头上，像是在对她承诺，又像是在对自己低语。","roundId":"round_1782839923220_hlyapwtdg","userId":"uid_1776582415926_1pk28whsh","characterId":"43acfb2a-2750-4525-9105-d6cef334953c","_id":50744},{"id":1782823522253,"text":"睡吧，小笨蛋。","rawContent":"睡吧，小笨蛋。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1782839954253,"roundId":"round_1782839923220_hlyapwtdg","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1776582415926_1pk28whsh","characterId":"43acfb2a-2750-4525-9105-d6cef334953c","_id":50745},{"id":1782823522254,"text":"我也比昨天更喜欢你。","rawContent":"我也比昨天更喜欢你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1782839956167,"roundId":"round_1782839923220_hlyapwtdg","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1776582415926_1pk28whsh","characterId":"43acfb2a-2750-4525-9105-d6cef334953c","_id":50746},{"id":1782868458371,"text"